        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "83d25810-81a2-337a-b406-6d50f33493fe",
                "word": "кратно",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a30418a-5617-3b91-8e7d-b91e091c5dd3",
                        "entry_id": "83d25810-81a2-337a-b406-6d50f33493fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к кратный; повторяясь или повторяя что-либо несколько раз"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5234998f-5911-4377-9f88-253a4e13996b",
                                "sense_id": "7a30418a-5617-3b91-8e7d-b91e091c5dd3",
                                "text": "Колико кратно ни вспоминаю то время, ясно и живыми образами является оно передо мной."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56aae2f9-04e8-34d2-b5b7-abe1ca022497",
                        "entry_id": "83d25810-81a2-337a-b406-6d50f33493fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "в несколько раз"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5fe9b88-77a8-460d-9cfc-68fcf58c362f",
                                "sense_id": "56aae2f9-04e8-34d2-b5b7-abe1ca022497",
                                "text": "И бюджетный дефицит, и суверенные долги выросли кратно, а невозвратные долги корпораций как раз списаны и не были."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e074de20-7900-4522-85b2-48fc670796b3",
                                "sense_id": "56aae2f9-04e8-34d2-b5b7-abe1ca022497",
                                "text": "Затраты на его производство кратно меньше, а эффективность высокая."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "16fe6638-b6c0-4e7a-9ad2-acc5a094a035",
                        "source_entry_id": "83d25810-81a2-337a-b406-6d50f33493fe",
                        "target_lang_word": "multiply",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "multiply",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "084c486d-e41e-35cb-887c-bb97a58f6b92",
                                        "entry_id": "795600cc-63c4-3adc-998f-764cfa15c1fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To increase the amount, degree or number of (something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d72625e6-6e88-49e4-a99d-64ae1b2d94e5",
                                                "sense_id": "084c486d-e41e-35cb-887c-bb97a58f6b92",
                                                "text": "The motives to refuse obedience to government are many and strong ; impunity will multiply and enforce them"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61e58ea2-c64a-4ab8-9bc3-bc7a8399e016",
                                                "sense_id": "084c486d-e41e-35cb-887c-bb97a58f6b92",
                                                "text": "It would indeed be easy to multiply modern authorities respecting locustal food; one more authority shall suffice, from which it will appear that the Arabs make a sort of locust bread."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1847a1bc-1eb6-3f23-b99b-d4903beb8a70",
                                        "entry_id": "795600cc-63c4-3adc-998f-764cfa15c1fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform multiplication on (a number)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eae7ecc1-989e-4e5d-a078-3f36943cab2b",
                                                "sense_id": "1847a1bc-1eb6-3f23-b99b-d4903beb8a70",
                                                "text": "when you multiply 3 by 7, you get 21; he multiplied several numbers"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b749f34b-8d48-4f55-abd8-a832c65f8677",
                                                "sense_id": "1847a1bc-1eb6-3f23-b99b-d4903beb8a70",
                                                "text": "But that can be ignored, because the USTR has set ε at 4 and φ at 0.25, so when computed give an overall multiplier of 1 for the imports number. And multiplying by 1 makes no difference at all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c25e54de-4474-3430-a641-4bd7f2a7d6fc",
                                        "entry_id": "795600cc-63c4-3adc-998f-764cfa15c1fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To grow in number."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1c6b9fa-b7b6-3e9a-95ee-88665ace3af4",
                                        "entry_id": "795600cc-63c4-3adc-998f-764cfa15c1fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To breed or propagate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dd46ead-fdf9-42e2-8a4b-eb890eb8e414",
                                                "sense_id": "b1c6b9fa-b7b6-3e9a-95ee-88665ace3af4",
                                                "text": "[The researchers] noticed many of their pieces of [plastic marine] debris sported surface pits around two microns across.[…]Closer examination showed that some of these pits did, indeed, contain bacteria, and that in several cases these bacteria were dividing and thus, by the perverse arithmetic of biological terminology, multiplying."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a07b6be7-7efd-36d9-bc43-966b346f4d8d",
                                        "entry_id": "795600cc-63c4-3adc-998f-764cfa15c1fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform multiplication."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66248255-355d-48d1-93f0-94071f2518a1",
                                                "sense_id": "a07b6be7-7efd-36d9-bc43-966b346f4d8d",
                                                "text": "He had been multiplying, but it occurred to him he needed to resolve the exponents, first."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26a97b88-5b3a-31c0-b6b7-2bfad48fc6f7",
                                        "entry_id": "795600cc-63c4-3adc-998f-764cfa15c1fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be a factor in a multiplication with (another factor)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ee17f1d-84e4-419c-a9a0-1c345868fba5",
                                                "sense_id": "26a97b88-5b3a-31c0-b6b7-2bfad48fc6f7",
                                                "text": "This follows a similar process, counters having to be removed and replaced at each stage of the remaining part of the calculation except the final one, where 2 multiplies 3 to give 6."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f18c4cf-d0f3-47ff-8bf4-1db1fb556d96",
                                                "sense_id": "26a97b88-5b3a-31c0-b6b7-2bfad48fc6f7",
                                                "text": "Of all the possible combinations of factors above, only (2#92;cdot4)#43;(3#92;cdot5)#61;23. Carefully arranging the factors, therefore, to ensure that 2 multiplies 4 and 3 multiplies 5, we have\n6x²#43;23x#43;20#61;(2x#43;5)(3x#43;4)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "multiply",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b5b6912-5be1-3912-ae7c-919d09ea070c",
                                        "entry_id": "06bb549e-e427-361c-bbb2-64f24b1f8c38",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act or instance of multiplying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e2c38ec-8180-45ac-8cab-8ba36149e369",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6912-5be1-3912-ae7c-919d09ea070c",
                                                "text": "The extended instruction set may double the speed again if a lot of multiplies and divides are done."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89ede180-e6ac-4108-9983-79ddce2e46e7",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6912-5be1-3912-ae7c-919d09ea070c",
                                                "text": "List the number of adds and multiplies for each of the forms (6) , (7), and (8)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "multiply",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
